      "translatedText": "The node subscribes cloud_in only when there is a subscriber to the scan output; after the last scan subscriber disappears, it unsubscribes from the point cloud\\. Both input and output use SensorDataQoS; compatible subscription QoS and a valid TF are prerequisites for receiving scans\\. Even when all points are filtered out, a scan frame consisting entirely of no\\-return values can still be published; therefore, the presence of a scan message must not be taken as an indication that the obstacle contour is correct\\.",
