      "sourceText": "- `auto` 不是弱类型，只是让编译器帮你写类型。\n- `nullptr` 只表示空指针，不表示整数。\n- `enum class` 默认不和整数混用。\n- 范围 for 默认用 `const auto&` 遍历大对象。\n- 结构化绑定适合解包 `pair`、`tuple`、结构体和 `map` 元素。",
      "translatedText": "- `auto` is not weak typing; it just lets the compiler write types for you\\.\n- `nullptr` represents only a null pointer, not an integer\\.\n- `enum class` is not mixed with integers by default\\.\n- The range for uses `const auto&` to iterate over large objects by default\\.\n- Structured bindings are suitable for unpacking `pair`, `tuple`, structs, and `map` elements\\.",
